    "title": "U.S. Navy brings immersive STEM experience to Tyler ISD CTC students - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago TYLER, Texas — Tyler ISD students got a hands-on look at Navy careers Thursday when recruiters brought an immersive STEM event to the district’s Career and Technology Center. Students tested their skills on Navy fitness challenges, including pull-ups, dips and rope pulling. They also stepped into virtual simulations... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
